{
  "name": "12. Firm offer to chosen mill WeChat",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## WF12 — FO to chosen mill (WeChat text)\nFires when Matt **emails the firm offer** to the buyer. Sends **one** WeChat to the **selected mill only**.\n\n**Price = mill RFQ quote (`supplierUnitPrice`). Never buyer / margin.**\nDo not reuse WF7 (that fans out to every mill).\n\nCopy is a letter, so this uses customer-service **text**, not a template (20-char fields would chop it).\n\nAfter import:\n1. Select **Google Sheets** (same as WF7) and **WeChat** HTTP Query Auth on Get Token\n2. Production URL must be `POST …/webhook/notify_mill_on_firm_offer`\n3. Publish this workflow. Optional Vercel: `DESK_FIRM_OFFER_MILL_WEBHOOK_URL` (already defaults to that path)\n4. Mill must have talked to the OA in the last **48 hours** or WeChat returns 45015\n5. If WeChat ID is blank on the offer, it matches **Company Name** on the Suppliers sheet",
        "height": 520,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "a12-note-mill-fo",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-640, -160]
    },
    {
